Simple diode distortion (line-in/line-out scaled)
* Host input sample (EXT IN) is treated as normalized audio [-1, 1].
* EIN scales to ~+4 dBu line level (1.736 Vpk), and EOUT scales back.
VINRAW INRAW 0 EXT IN
EIN IN 0 INRAW 0 1.736
RIN IN CLIP 10k
RLEAK CLIP 0 1000k
D1 CLIP 0 IS=4.3n N=1.9
D2 0 CLIP IS=4.3n N=1.9
EOUT OUT 0 CLIP 0 0.576
PROBE OUT
